title: "Streaming Early-Stop for Step-Level LLM Verification: A Minimal Reproducible Study"
type: software
version: "0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Yin
    given-names: Kang
    affiliation: ""
    orcid: ""
abstract: >-
  A small-sample, single-model, single-run engineering study of early stopping in streaming step-level
  verification. Reports trigger rate, estimated token/latency savings, mis-stop rate and replay consistency,
  plus a zero-API replay demo and an open call for collaboration. No performance, accuracy, first or SOTA claim.
keywords:
  - streaming verification
  - early stopping
  - fail-closed
  - step-level verification
  - reproducible research
